t its weekly limit; no cross-vendor approval is claimed.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:36:4. Finish artifact/surface checks, native sealed review and closeout before done or adoption. Default artifact attribution reconciled 82 claims with no errors. The Harne8 binding still points at 8aa729a7; do not update it merely because local tests pass.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:48:@pose-maintainers coordena a verificação dos registros nativos de closeout e eventual adoção; consulte o Final Report da spec para o resultado final.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-20-handoff-pose-b07-implementation.md:53:- [ADR MCP](../adr/2026-10-20-expose-the-closeout-execution-plan-as-an-opt-in-mcp-projection.md).\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-04-handoff-pose-b34-implementation.md:31:global seguinte falhou por agregação das closures de closeout e diagnósticos\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-04-handoff-pose-b34-implementation.md:36:bundle final, revisão Claude, atestação ou closeout. Os registros abaixo conservam\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-04-handoff-pose-b34-implementation.md:82:5. Aplicar o closeout nativo, repetir os gates pós-fechamento e publicar sem\n.pose/knowledge/2026-10-13-decision-log-review-assurance-requires-cryptographic-proof.md:26:Direct disclosure, verify, review-check, closeout and attribution consume the same authority proof check. Invalid proof never yields a verified claim that could authenticate human confirmation. No records, policy, schema or capability adoption are rewritten. Current issuer pins/grants and current expiry semantics remain; historical trust and reuse provenance require the separate B04 delta.\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-09-24-handoff-multirepo-review-continuation.md:12:  commands: [\"pose review verify spec:pose-agent-project-context\", \"pose closeout-check roadmap:pose-multirepo-foundation\", \"pose validate --strict --module pose-mcp --json .pose/results/delivery-validation.json --report\"]\n.pose/knowl